# viewport 1440x900
until 1200 ODDWATER
frames 20
key KeyJ 2
click Habitat
expect Small places, different lives
click Moss garden · 12 W
frames 2
expect Moss garden placed
click Middle bed
click Leaf litter · 6 W
frames 2
expect Leaf litter placed
save ecology-layout
click Colony
expect 7 / 13 shrimp
click Shelter brood · 12 W
frames 2
expect Grow a moss bed
key KeyJ 2
click 20×
frames 1800
key KeyJ 2
click Colony
click Shelter brood · 12 W
frames 2
expect Cherry brood
save ecology-brood
key KeyJ 2
frames 2000
key KeyJ 2
click Welcome shrimplets
frames 2
expect 9 / 13 shrimp
save ecology-young
click ←
frames 2
expect Cherry shrimp #15
click Watch
frames 2
expect Growing among the moss
click Record behavior
frames 2
expect Behavior recorded
save ecology-observation
key KeyJ 2
click Field notes
expect Patient fieldwork
save ecology-notes
click Colony
key KeyJ 2
frames 3600
key KeyJ 2
click Share two adults
frames 2
expect 7 / 13 shrimp
expect Two grown shrimp shared
save ecology-shared
click Shelter brood · 12 W
frames 2
expect Cherry brood
save ecology-next-generation
